# Title: Chromium Browser Headless Execution To Mockbin Like Site
# ID: 1c526788-0abe-4713-862f-b520da5e5316
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: X__Junior (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-09-11
# Tags: attack.execution
# Description: Detects the execution of a Chromium based browser process with the "headless" flag and a URL pointing to the mockbin.org service (which can be used to exfiltrate data).
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:*--headless*) AND ((process.executable:*\\brave.exe OR process.executable:*\\chrome.exe OR process.executable:*\\msedge.exe OR process.executable:*\\opera.exe OR process.executable:*\\vivaldi.exe)) AND ((process.command_line:*://run.mocky* OR process.command_line:*://mockbin*)))
